      en: ["Established in 1967 in the eastern port city of Toamasina.", "Specializes in processing local palm oil and copra (dried coconut).", "Manufactures domestic soap, edible cooking oils, and margarine.", "Reduces national reliance on imported hygiene and food products.", "Sources raw materials from a vast network of eastern smallholder farmers.", "A key example of value-added agricultural manufacturing in Madagascar."]
