      en: ["A state-owned forestry enterprise based in the town of Moramanga.", "Manages approximately 70,000 hectares of artificial pine plantations.", "The primary species cultivated is the fast-growing Pinus patula.", "Operates extensive sawmills producing structural timber and poles.", "Supplies essential raw material to the domestic paper industry.", "Helps reduce commercial logging pressure on Madagascar's natural rainforests."]
