      en: ["A major industrial fishing operation based in the port of Nosy Be.", "Operates a fleet of commercial trawlers in the Mozambique Channel.", "Primarily targets high-value pink shrimp and commercial tuna.", "Features extensive onshore facilities for blast-freezing and processing.", "Exports premium seafood directly to luxury markets in Europe and Japan.", "Faces ongoing challenges regarding overfishing and strict EU regulations."]
